cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "R code and processed data for Circular Data Analysis for Spatial Omics"
abstract: >-
  R code and processed data for circular data analysis in spatial omics,
  reproducing the case studies of derived circadian peak phase in a mouse
  model of Alzheimer's disease and latent cell-cycle position in human
  ovarian cancer. Code and data are archived together at Zenodo.
